  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Emergency Lifesaving Health, Nutrition, WASH and Protection Support for vulnerable populations affected by adverse effects of flooding in South Central Somalia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To respond to flooding associated with the Gu rains, Caafimaad consortium is implementing an integrated response (health, nutrition, WASH, and protection) that will layer services in existing facilities, existing communties, as well as new settlements that are identified as high risk locations</narrative>
  </description>
